   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Interior photo of a typical Living Room in a residence in a middle class apartment in Mumbai. The furniture layout shows couches, centre table, TV unit, storage unit, and wall art. Property prices are riding considerably in India, and affordable housing is difficult to find.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
